2. Reconstructed game code: NOT covered by the MIT License
----------------------------------------------------------

  src/game/       reconstruction of the game logic of Hopmon,
                  (c) 2001-2009 Saito Games
  src/framework/  (except interp.cpp/interp.h) reconstruction of the DirectX 7 SDK
                  sample framework the game was built on, (c) Microsoft
                  Corporation, with Saito Games' modifications

These files reproduce the behaviour and structure of the original program so
that it can run on modern systems. The rights to that original work belong to
its owners, and no license to it is granted here. The native additions inside
these folders are marked "Native" or "native addition" in the source comments.

Hopmon, its name, artwork, levels, sounds and music are (c) Saito Games. None of
them are included in this repository; they are read at runtime from the user's
own copy of the freeware game.


3. Third-party code
-------------------

The files in third_party/ keep their own licenses. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
SDL3 (zlib license) is downloaded at build time and is not included here.
